---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Fabrication Services | Ursa fab."
  description="Studio carts, production equipment, stainless kitchens, shelving, custom fabrication and CAD services from Ursa fab. in Norwich."
  image="/services.jpeg"
>
  <Header alwaysVisible />

  <main class="services-page">
    <header class="services-intro">
      <p class="content-label">services</p>
      <h1>Bespoke, beautiful, accessible.</h1>
    </header>

    <section class="services-list" aria-label="Ursa fab. services">
      <article class="service-item">
        <div>
          <h2><a href="/studio-carts/">Production equipment</a></h2>
          <p>
            Studio carts, mobile workstations, storage systems and purpose-built
            equipment for film, television and creative production environments.
            <br/>
            <br/>
            This is our bread and butter - designs are constantly refined and
            custom solutions are encouraged.
            <br/>
            <br/>
            At this time, please contact us for a list of example pieces and prices.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="service-item">
        <div>
          <h2>Contemporary interiors</h2>
          <p>
            Stainless kitchen cabinetry, worktops and sinks; multi-material shelving, furniture and fitted interior elements.
            <br/>
            <br/>
            All works made to order, to suit you and your space - see our gallery and social media for examples.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="service-item">
        <div>
          <h2>Custom fabrication</h2>
          <p>
            One-off works combining metalwork and timber, with careful and considered construction, 
            from concept through to completion. Whether it's niche, necessary, or just plain nice, 
            we'll do out best to make it happen.
            <br/>
            <br/>
            For full commissions, please contact us for a quote; welding and machining services are priced at £40/hour (VAT not applicable).
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
      
      <article class="service-item">
        <div>
          <h2>CAD modelling and drawing</h2>
          <p>
            Whether it starts from a piece of paper, a conversation or a thought, everything we build 
            goes through a computer aided design process in-house for the best possible outcome.
            <br/>
            <br/>
            If you're looking to get something made, we can work from your sketches and ideas to draft 
            manufacturing drawings and models, check and advise on existing digital concepts, 
            or produce renders from your own 3D files.
            <br/>
            <br/>
            Small jobs are undertaken for a flat fee of £60; for more complicated works reach out for a discussion.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
